{"id":"d980a515087fba05","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-priestley-duality.md","title":"thm-priestley-duality","display":"thm-priestley-duality","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-priestley-dual]]"],"display":"thm-priestley-duality","label":"93-thm-priestley-duality","aliases":["93-thm-priestley-duality"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18e84a8354274052\" href=\"?note=18e84a8354274052\" title=\"93-df-priestley-dual\">93-df-priestley-dual</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-priestley-duality"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-priestley-duality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-priestley-duality</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-priestley-duality-thm-priestley-duality\">thm-priestley-duality <code>thm-priestley-duality</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L=\\langle L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbf L=\\langle L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1\\rangle\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The prime-filter space <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X_{\\mathbf L},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L},\\preceq_{\\mathbf L})\">\\((X_{\\mathbf L},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L},\\preceq_{\\mathbf L})\\)</span>, its clopen-upset algebra, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{\\mathbf L}\">\\(\\eta_{\\mathbf L}\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"18e84a8354274052\" href=\"?note=18e84a8354274052\" title=\"93-df-priestley-dual\">93-df-priestley-dual</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrSpace}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrSpace}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClopUpAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClopUpAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BDLIso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BDLIso}_{93}\\)</span> have their source signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}priestley\\text{-}duality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PrSpace}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf L},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L},\\preceq_{\\mathbf L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{BDLIso}_{93}\\!\\left(\n\\eta_{\\mathbf L},\\mathbf L,\n\\mathrm{ClopUpAlg}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf L},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L},\\preceq_{\\mathbf L})\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}priestley\\text{-}duality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PrSpace}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf L},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L},\\preceq_{\\mathbf L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{BDLIso}_{93}\\!\\left(\n\\eta_{\\mathbf L},\\mathbf L,\n\\mathrm{ClopUpAlg}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf L},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L},\\preceq_{\\mathbf L})\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The topology, order, canonical map, and clopen-upset algebra all refer to the same construction, with an isomorphism predicate tailored to the bounded-lattice encoding.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-priestley-duality-thm-priestley-duality","text":"thm-priestley-duality `thm-priestley-duality`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-priestley-dual","status":"resolved","id":"18e84a8354274052","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":""